["<aside class=\"callout why\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>A rifle that is not zeroed misses where you aim. A 50 m zero turns the CZ into a point and shoot tool for grouse.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 314\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Close up of the CZ 457 folding rear sight (manual Fig. 8): 1 a slider with marks every 25 m from 25 to 200 m, 2 a button you press before moving the slider, 3 a windage screw on each side of the sight plate. CZ says the distance marks are only indicative and depend on the ammunition.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"314\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Rear sight: distance and windage</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"44\" width=\"376\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"150\" width=\"360\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#4A5156\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"120\" width=\"220\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M260 120 L300 80 L312 84 L280 120 Z\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"120\" y=\"112\" width=\"120\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#4A5156\"/><rect x=\"128\" y=\"114\" width=\"2\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"152\" y=\"114\" width=\"2\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"176\" y=\"114\" width=\"2\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"114\" width=\"2\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"224\" y=\"114\" width=\"2\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"196\" y=\"100\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#D8B23A\"/><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"108\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><rect x=\"84\" y=\"128\" width=\"8\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#D8B23A\"/><rect x=\"308\" y=\"128\" width=\"8\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#D8B23A\"/><circle cx=\"207\" cy=\"72\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"207\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><line x1=\"207\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"207\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"72\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">2</text><line x1=\"246\" y1=\"82\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"102\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"139\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">3</text><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"139\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">3</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"217\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Slider: marks 25 to 200 m</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"241\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">2</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Button: press, then slide</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"265\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">3</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Windage screws, both sides</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Marks are a guide. Your ammo decides (CZ).</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Factory zero for iron sights: 50 m <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Rear sight: windage. Front sight: elevation <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: iron sights in full</summary><ul><li>\"The CZ 457 rimfire rifle enables rear sight adjustment for windage and front sight adjustment for elevation ... The sights have been zeroed at 50 m in the factory\" (95%, CZ manual page 8).</li><li>\"The folding rear sight ... is provided with marks corresponding to 25 m for the shooting distance from 25 to 200 m. When you press the button, use the slider to set the required shooting distance (the distances are only indicative and may vary depending on the ammunition used)\" <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Windage: \"unscrewing the screw on the side of the rear sight plate to which you wish to shift the mean point of impact to and ... tightening the screw on the other side\" (95%, Fig. 8).</li><li>Not every CZ 457 has iron sights; the American has none (85%, CZ USA). <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> yours.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 308\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Left: the CZ 457 front sight in its hood, with a pair of screws that set the height (manual Fig. 9). Right: the rule of thumb. Move the rear sight the way you want the hits to go. Raise the front blade and the hits go lower. CZ zeroes the open sights at 50 m in the factory.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"308\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Front sight and which way to move</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"44\" width=\"184\" height=\"160\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"150\" width=\"168\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#4A5156\"/><path d=\"M60 150 L70 82 Q104 64 138 82 L148 150 Z\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M84 150 L90 100 Q104 92 118 100 L124 150 Z\" fill=\"#D9E0D5\"/><rect x=\"100\" y=\"108\" width=\"8\" height=\"42\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><circle cx=\"136\" cy=\"118\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#D8B23A\"/><circle cx=\"138\" cy=\"136\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#D8B23A\"/><circle cx=\"166\" cy=\"118\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"166\" y=\"123\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"118\" x2=\"141\" y2=\"118\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"124\" x2=\"143\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"104\" y=\"226\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">Front: 2 screws set</text><text x=\"104\" y=\"244\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">the height (Fig. 9)</text><rect x=\"204\" y=\"44\" width=\"184\" height=\"200\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"296\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Which way?</text><text x=\"216\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Rear sight:</text><text x=\"216\" y=\"118\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">move it the way</text><text x=\"216\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">you want hits to go</text><text x=\"216\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Front sight:</text><text x=\"216\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">higher blade =</text><text x=\"216\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">hits go lower</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"262\" width=\"384\" height=\"34\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"284.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">Factory zero: 50 m (CZ)</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Rear sight: move it the way you want the hits to go <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">90%</span>.</li><li>Higher front blade: hits go lower <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">90%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the elevation rule</summary><ul><li>\"Elevation adjustment of the front sight can be carried out using the pair of front screws (Fig. 9)\" (95%, CZ manual page 8).</li><li>Front and rear sight rules are geometry: moving the rear sight up or the front sight down raises the point of impact (90%, standard iron sight practice).</li><li>Change one thing at a time, then shoot a new group (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 376\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cross section through the CZ 457 receiver from the back. 1 the scope ring jaws clamp onto 2 the 11 mm dovetail grooves cut into the top of the receiver. 3 the bolt runs inside. CZ also allows a Weaver rail.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"376\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">The 11 mm dovetail, end view</text><path d=\"M110 250 L110 150 Q110 120 140 112 L260 112 Q290 120 290 150 L290 250 Z\" fill=\"#4A5156\"/><path d=\"M150 112 L142 96 L258 96 L250 112 Z\" fill=\"#8C959B\"/><path d=\"M124 96 L142 96 L150 112 L136 120 L118 104 Z\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M276 96 L258 96 L250 112 L264 120 L282 104 Z\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M118 104 L118 70 Q200 40 282 70 L282 104\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"200\" r=\"34\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"200\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#C9CFD3\"/><line x1=\"142\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">11 mm</text><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"104\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"109\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><line x1=\"308\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"284\" y2=\"104\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"120\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">2</text><line x1=\"92\" y1=\"118\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"200\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">3</text><line x1=\"318\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"234\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"277\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Ring clamp jaws</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"301\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"306\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">2</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"306\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Dovetail grooves on the receiver</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"325\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"330\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">3</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"330\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Bolt inside the receiver</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"362\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Weaver rail is the other option (CZ).</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Rings clamp straight onto the receiver <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Or fit a Weaver rail <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: mounts in full</summary><ul><li>\"The rifle scope is to be installed on an 11 mm dovetail on the receiver using rifle scope mounts or via a Weaver rail\" (95%, CZ manual page 8).</li><li>CZ: \"Mounting of the riflescope and sighting-in of the rifle should be entrusted to a qualified gunsmith's workshop\" <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. Many owners mount their own with care and a torque driver (Tip). My lean: first time, do it at the gun shop counter and watch.</li><li>Buy rings made for an 11 mm rimfire dovetail, and match ring size to the scope tube: 1 in (25.4 mm) or 30 mm (80%, ring makers' listings).</li><li>One ring maker's spec for its CZ 457 rings: 2 to 2.5 Nm (newton metres) (65%, CZ Parts online store tutorial). Use your ring maker's number first.</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"steps\" data-n=\"5\"><div class=\"steps-head\"><b>Mount a scope on the CZ in 5 steps</b><span class=\"steps-count\">1 of 5</span></div><div class=\"steps-track\"><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mounting a scope on the CZ 457, step 1 of 5: Ring bases on. Clean, then clamp the bases on the dovetail.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"14\" fill