ke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M178 141 Q183 150 176 156\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"231\" y=\"139\" width=\"4\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#D8B23A\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"158\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"138\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"162\" y=\"90\" width=\"10\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"214\" y=\"90\" width=\"10\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M120 80 L140 84 L246 84 L272 78 L272 96 L246 92 L140 92 L120 96 Z\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"186\" y=\"76\" width=\"12\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/></g><circle cx=\"169\" cy=\"52\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"169\" y=\"57\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><circle cx=\"217\" cy=\"88\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"217\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">2</text><circle cx=\"217\" cy=\"52\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"217\" y=\"57\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">3</text><circle cx=\"169\" cy=\"88\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"169\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">4</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">Cross pattern</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">Even gaps, a little at a time.</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"258\" width=\"384\" height=\"34\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">Unloaded, bolt out or open. PROVE it first.</text></svg>\n<figcaption><b>5.</b> Tighten the top screws in a cross pattern.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"steps-nav\"><button class=\"steps-prev\" aria-label=\"Back\">‹ Back</button><span class=\"steps-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><button class=\"steps-next\" aria-label=\"Next\">Next ›</button></div></div><ul><li>PROVE it unloaded first <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: mounting in full</summary><ul><li>Degrease the dovetail and ring bases so they grip (65%, CZ Parts online store tutorial).</li><li>Eye relief: in your real shooting position, slide the scope until you see a full picture with no black ring, then stop (Tip). More: <a href=\"#/s/optics-mastery\">optics mastery</a> and <a href=\"#/s/scope-guide\">choose a scope</a>.</li><li><button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Eye relief\">Eye relief</button> on rimfire scopes is often long; a .22 has almost no recoil, so eye relief is about comfort, not scope bite (Tip).</li><li>Level: rifle level in a rest, vertical crosshair straight up and down (Tip).</li><li>Tops: tighten a little at a time, corner to corner, keep the gaps even on both sides (Tip, common ring maker instruction).</li><li>Check the bolt handle clears the eyepiece at the full 60 degree lift (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 364\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Bullet path of a .22 LR, 40 grain at 1,235 feet per second, scope 4 cm over the bore. Zeroed at 50 m (solid orange) it stays within about 1.5 cm from 15 to 55 m, is 6 cm low at 75 m and 19 cm low at 100 m. Zeroed at 25 m (dashed) it is 1 cm low at 50 m and 21 cm low at 100 m. Hunt Mentor model, 75%.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"364\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Zero at 25 m, then 50 m</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"60\" width=\"330\" height=\"210\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"130.0\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"130.0\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"132.5\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"132.5\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"132.5\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">25 m</text><line x1=\"215.0\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"215.0\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"215.0\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">50 m</text><line x1=\"297.5\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"297.5\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"297.5\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">75 m</text><line x1=\"380.0\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"380.0\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"380.0\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">100 m</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"135.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#17201A\">0</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"195.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#17201A\">-10</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"255.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#17201A\">-20</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">cm</text><path d=\"M50.0 154.0 L99.5 136.0 L132.5 130.0 L182.0 130.0 L215.0 136.0 L297.5 178.0 L380.0 256.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><path d=\"M50.0 154.0 L99.5 136.0 L132.5 127.0 L182.0 125.2 L215.0 130.0 L297.5 166.0 L380.0 244.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"305\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">50 m zero: dead on 15 to 55 m</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"324\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"324\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"329\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">25 m zero: first step only</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"352\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">Model: 40 gr at 1,235 fps (75%)</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>First shots at 25 m get you on paper (Tip).</li><li>Final zero at 50 m: dead on from 15 to 55 m <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: zeroing step by step</summary><ol><li>PROVE it, then bore sight: bolt out, rifle in a rest, look through the bore from the chamber at a target 25 m away, then move the crosshair onto the same spot (Tip).</li><li>At 25 m: 3 shots from a solid rest. Move the group onto the aim point (Tip).</li><li>At 50 m: 5 shot groups. Fine tune until the group centre is on the aim point (Tip).</li><li>Confirm at 25, 40 and 75 m to learn your holds (75%, Hunt Mentor model).</li><li>Model numbers for a 40 grain bullet at 1,235 fps (feet per second), scope 4 cm over the bore: 50 m zero is 6 cm low at 75 m and 19 cm low at 100 m (75%, from <a href=\"#/s/rimfire-22\">the .22 rimfire</a>).</li><li>Same steps for iron sights, starting from the factory 50 m zero (95%, CZ page 8).</li><li>Full method: <a href=\"#/s/sighting-in\">sighting in</a>.</li></ol></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 336\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A 5 shot group low and left of the aim point on a 1 cm grid. Turn the turrets up and right. A quarter MOA click moves the hit about 0.7 cm at 100 m, 0.36 cm at 50 m and 0.18 cm at 25 m. Clicks needed equals the miss in cm divided by the click value at that distance.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"336\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Move the group with clicks</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"44\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"45\" y2=\"244\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"69\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"244\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"94\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"94\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"95\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"244\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"119\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"244\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"144\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"144\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"145\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"145\" y2=\"244\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"169\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"169\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"244\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"194\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"194\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"195\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"195\" y2=\"244\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"219\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"219\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"144\" r=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"144\" x2=\"134\" y2=\"144\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"62\" cy=\"196\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"204\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"58\" cy=\"208\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"200\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"210\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><line x1=\"66\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"66.0\" y2=\"161.0\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M66 150 L60.0 161.0 L72.0 161.0z\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><line x1=\"66\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"101.0\" y2=\"150.0\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M112 150 L101.0 144.0 L101.0 156.0z\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Group: low left</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Move it: UP and</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">RIGHT</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">1/4 MOA click:</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">0.7 cm at 100 m</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"192\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">0.36 cm at 50 m</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">0.18 cm at 25 m</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"262\" width=\"384\" height=\"34\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"284.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">Clicks needed = miss (cm) / click (cm)</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"324\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">Grid squares here: 1 cm. Read your turret.</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Close range means more clicks <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Half the distance: twice the clicks <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: click math</summary><ul><li>A <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"MOA\">MOA</button> (minute of angle) is about 2.9 cm at 100 m, so a quarter MOA click is about 0.73 cm at 100 m, 0.36 cm at 50 m and 0.18 cm at 25 m (95%, geometry).</li><li>Example: group 3.6 cm low at 50 m with quarter MOA clicks: 3.6 / 0.36 = 10 clicks UP (95%, math).</li><li>Some rimfire scopes have different click values or are set for 50 yd parallax. Read your scope's manual (Tip).</li><li>Turret arrows say which way moves the hits. Trust the arrow, then check on paper (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 364\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Bullet path of a .22 LR, 40 grain at 1,235 feet per second, scope 4 cm over the bore. Zeroed at 50 m (solid orange) it stays within about 1.5 cm from 15 to 55 m, is 6 cm low at 75 m and 19 cm low at 100 m. Zeroed at 25 m (dashed) it is 1 cm low at 50 m and 21 cm low at 100 m. Hunt Mentor model, 75%.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"364\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Zero at 25 m, then 50 m</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"60\" width=\"330\" height=\"210\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"130.0\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"130.0\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"132.5\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"132.5\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"132.5\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">25 m</text><line x1=\"215.0\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"215.0\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"215.0\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">50 m</text><line x1=\"297.5\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"297.5\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"297.5\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">75 m</text><line x1=\"380.0\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"380.0\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#D9E0D5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"380.0\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">100 m</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"135.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#17201A\">0</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"195.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#17201A\">-10</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"255.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#17201A\">-20</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">cm</text><path d=\"M50.0 154.0 L99.5 136.0 L132.5 130.0 L182.0 130.0 L215.0 136.0 L297.5 178.0 L380.0 256.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><path d=\"M50.0 154.0 L99.5 136.0 L132.5 127.0 L182.0 125.2 L215.0 130.0 L297.5 166.0 L380.0 244.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"305\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">50 m zero: dead on 15 to 55 m</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"324\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"324\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"329\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">25 m zero: first step only</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"352\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">Model: 40 gr at 1,235 fps (75%)</text></svg>\n</figure><aside class=\"callout rule\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Grandpa's rule (wisdom): Zero with the ammo you hunt with. Change ammo, zero again.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Zeroing at 25 m and calling it done. At 50 m you are about 1 cm low <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Overtightening ring screws and crushing the scope tube.</li><li>Cranking turrets after every shot instead of after a group.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Write your zero, ammo and date on tape inside the scope cap.</p></aside>","<ul><li>CZ 457 manual page 8 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. Ballistic model <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>. Ring tutorial <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>. Checked 2026-10-23.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: all sources</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://czubpimstorage.blob.core.windows.net/strapi-pim/assets/735342000443_CZ_457_05_2025_en_es_cs_de_fr_8dc25ceb9d.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CZ 457 instruction manual, 05 2025 (PDF)</a>: page 8 (sight adjustment, factory 50 m zero, rifle scope, 11 mm dovetail, Weaver rail, gunsmith advice), Figs. 8 and 9. Read directly 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://cz-parts.com/blogs/tutorials/how-to-mount-a-scope-to-cz-457\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CZ Parts store: how to mount a scope to a CZ 457</a>: ring torque 2 to 2.5 Nm for its rings, degrease, threadlocker. Search preview 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>Trajectory: Hunt Mentor model in <a href=\"#/s/rimfire-22\">the .22 rimfire</a> lesson <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>MOA and click math: geometry <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://www.czfirearms.com/en-us/products/rimfire-rifles/cz-457-series/cz-457-american\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CZ USA product pages</a> for which models have sights <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li></ul></details>"]